GET {{baseUrl}}/anything/vars

::: query
value = {{template}}

::: pre
vars.set("template", "{{userName}}");

::: post
test("a value set by a script is not expanded again", () => {
  expect(res.json().args.value).toBe("{{userName}}");
});

::: docs
Only the values of environment files are expanded: a script value is used as given.
